{"id":"n26146-1-7","stage":3,"title":"중식 · 中国菜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26146-1-7-1","ko":"우리 집 앞에 있는 중국집은 중식을 잘해.","zh":"我家前面的中餐馆做中餐很拿手。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家，店","explanation":"집：家，店","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"7","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중국집은","meaning":"中国餐厅，中华料理店","explanation":"중국집：中国餐厅，中华料理店；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"중국집","audio":"/audio/51578270f8750bdf6044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26017","senseId":"1","lemma":"중국집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중식을","meaning":"中国菜，中餐","explanation":"중식：中国菜，中餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"중식","audio":"/audio/841ae0a1e6959fbfb79a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26146","senseId":"1","lemma":"중식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘해.","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，店","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"表示“销售商品的店铺”或“营业的店铺”。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"51578270f8750bdf","term":"중국집","zh":"中国餐厅，中华料理店","audio":"/audio/51578270f8750bdf6044.mp3","entryId":"26017","definition":"制作中国料理的餐厅。","pronunciation":["중국찝"]},{"id":"841ae0a1e6959fbf","term":"중식","zh":"中国菜，中餐","audio":"/audio/841ae0a1e6959fbfb79a.mp3","entryId":"26146","definition":"中国风味的餐食菜肴。","pronunciation":["중식"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/acc334f7a9902cd147a4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26146-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 오늘 점심은 거기에서 자장면이나 짬뽕을 시켜 먹자.","zh":"那今天午饭从那里点炸酱面或辣海鲜面吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심은","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거기에서","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那里；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"2","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자장면이나","meaning":"韩式炸酱面","explanation":"자장면：韩式炸酱面；이나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"자장면","audio":"/audio/11a41c91582062e1f6ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23362","senseId":"1","lemma":"자장면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짬뽕을","meaning":"韩式炒码面，韩式海鲜辣汤面","explanation":"짬뽕：韩式炒码面，韩式海鲜辣汤面；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짬뽕","audio":"/audio/ce5ff89346f987bee851.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78928","senseId":"1","lemma":"짬뽕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시켜","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"11a41c91582062e1","term":"자장면","zh":"韩式炸酱面","audio":"/audio/11a41c91582062e1f6ec.mp3","entryId":"23362","definition":"将肉类、蔬菜等食材伴着春酱炒成调料酱，再浇在面条上拌着吃的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ce5ff89346f987be","term":"짬뽕","zh":"韩式炒码面，韩式海鲜辣汤面","audio":"/audio/ce5ff89346f987bee851.mp3","entryId":"78928","definition":"将各种海鲜和蔬菜炒熟，并倒入辣汤煮至而成的中式面条。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0258d8fe6108bb9c","term":"시키다","zh":"点，叫","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3","entryId":"29769","definition":"下单购买食物、酒、饮料等。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/74cf1315ab19d1395fd0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26146","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我家前面的中餐馆做中餐很拿手。","那今天午饭从那里点炸酱面或辣海鲜面吧。","哇，这是什么相册？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我家前面的中餐馆做中餐很拿手。","那今天午饭从那里点炸酱面或辣海鲜面吧。","哇，这是什么相册？"],"answer":1}]}
